<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-LONGO RETAINS WOMEN'S WORLD TIME TRIAL TITLE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LONGO RETAINS WOMEN'S WORLD TIME TRIAL TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LUGANO, Switzerland 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jeannie Longo of</p>
<p>France retained the women's time trial title at the world road</p>
<p>race championships on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Catherine Marsal, also of France, took the silver and</p>
<p>Alessandra Cappellotto of Italy the bronze.</p>
</text>
